  Reader/Writer) lifted from fuse-backend-rs 0.14.0
  (https://crates.io/hv/crates/fuse-backend-rs), the published successor of
  crosvm's BSD `fuse` crate, adapted to this workspace's vm-memory and
  virtio-queue versions and cut down to the virtqueue transport. Licence:
  BSD-3-Clause (at the user's option also Apache-2.0); the upstream headers
  and copyright lines are retained in each file. See the crate's
