  commit 7a941dfb2877a0b8cf30323fefa85ad019e0b0f5: the encodings, fields,
  format classes and names of the instruction records, and the system
  register and system operation tables. tests/vectors.txt holds the record
  names that llvm-mc of the same commit prints. Made by
  hv/crates/vmlab-hv-tcg-a64gen from the pins in
  hv/toolchain/llvm/. Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception.

